# OpenWiki scope for MoSynth.
#
# Goal: leave only first-party source and design docs visible, so the wiki is
# about MoSynth's own systems rather than Unity's generated project files or
# vendored dependencies. Mirrors .contextignore (used by the semantic index)
# and adds the generated-project noise that would otherwise dominate.

# --- Vendored / third-party ---
External/
Assets/Packages/
Assets/Samples/
Assets/Lib/

# --- Nested repos and local scratch (not part of the shipped project) ---
Assets/LFS/
Assets/Local/

# --- Unity generated project files (~180 .csproj at the repo root) ---
*.csproj
*.csproj.DotSettings
*.sln
*.sln.DotSettings.user
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
UserSettings/
.idea/
.vs/

# --- Unity YAML sidecars ---
# Large serialized blobs; the C# type definitions are the real source of truth
# for what these assets contain.
*.meta
*.asset
*.unity
*.prefab
*.controller
*.mat
*.anim
*.inputactions
Assets/Animation/
Assets/Meshes/
Assets/Prefabs/
Assets/Scenes/

# --- Run outputs and captures ---
Benchmarks/
Assets/Benchmarks/
ProfilerCaptures/
Recordings/

# --- Python bytecode / notebooks ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.ipynb

# --- Binary payloads ---
*.zip
*.fbx
*.onnx
*.dll
*.pyd
*.so
